WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:08.000
The user opens Screen Translation in Visay.

00:08.000 --> 00:13.000
Android requests the user's consent to share the screen.

00:13.000 --> 00:30.000
The screen-sharing session remains active while another app is open.

00:30.000 --> 00:50.000
The user taps the floating Visay button to capture and recognize screen text.

00:50.000 --> 01:12.000
Visay displays Japanese translations over the captured content.

01:12.000 --> 01:22.000
The user closes the translation overlay and opens the floating button controls.

01:22.000 --> 01:33.800
The user stops screen translation. The screen-sharing indicator disappears.
